> So, 50 would be way overkill, 20 would probably mean using
> them sparingly.  That's based on somewhat limited experience but
> teleport zaps have worked very well for me.

There may be the "random nasties" effect that will surround you with a
lot tough monsters! It's good to save a wand with a single charge left
to break it (breaking a full wand is just a waste); that will displace
all adjacent monsters, an emergency measure. Directed zaps are of limited
use in that case, or in case that an Archon keeps on summoning monsters.

To sum up; primary use is to get rid of surrounding monsters (may happen
anywhere) and to open you a path to quickly reach the altar (on Astral).

